{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17217020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17217020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721702001:1":{"text":"格温妮丝，关于今天……我很抱歉。临时有紧急公务绊住了脚，没能去赴约，让你久等了。","source_cn":"格温妮丝，关于今天……我很抱歉。临时有紧急公务绊住了脚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD9DE2DA3E80197","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721702002:1":{"text":"没关系，司令。身为军人，任务优先。我能理解您的苦衷，就像您总是有各种理由不让我参与调查一样。","source_cn":"没关系，司令。身为军人，任务优先。我能理解您的苦衷，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25B2D1F1A6A18880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721702003:1":{"text":"我知道你在生气。作为补偿，除了让你涉险去调查圣古堂消失一案外，其他的要求，只要我能做到的，我都答应你。","source_cn":"我知道你在生气。作为补偿，除了让你涉险去调查圣古堂消失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8414EC49563B10B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721702004:1":{"text":"真的吗？那好。既然您不让我调查，那就请您立刻下令——封锁并搜查上城区的<style=\"highlight\">“丝绒陷阱”</style>餐厅，逮捕其经营者法蒂玛！","source_cn":"真的吗？那好。既然您不让我调查，那就请您立刻下令——封...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC80F20D8E06CC6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721702005:2":{"text":"什么，查封丝绒陷阱？今天发生什么事了吗？","source_cn":"什么，查封丝绒陷阱？今天发生什么事了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D96609CCEAEE617","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_recor